{"session_id":"golden-session-01","asked":["q1"],"last_turn":{"turn_order":0,"transcript":"When our production checkout service started returning 500 errors on Black Friday I was on call at two in the morning. I needed to coordinate with the payments team and the infrastructure team while keeping customer support informed. I built a quick dashboard using Datadog metrics and traced the issue to a database connection leak introduced in the previous deploy. I wrote a rollback plan and decided to revert the migration then led the fix with a connection pool limit of fifty and added retry logic. The outcome was we restored service in twenty minutes, reduced error rate from twelve percent to zero, and shipped a postmortem that increased our on-call readiness. The project taught me to prioritize clear communication under pressure and to document decisions for future incidents.","formatted":true,"end_of_turn":true,"end_of_turn_confidence":0.92,"words":[{"text":"When","start":5000,"end":5250,"confidence":0.92,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"our","start":5350,"end":5600,"confidence":0.9400000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"production","start":5700,"end":5950,"confidence":0.9600000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"checkout","start":6050,"end":6300,"confidence":0.92,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"service","start":6400,"end":6650,"confidence":0.9400000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"started","start":6750,"end":7000,"confidence":0.9600000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"returning","start":7100,"end":7350,"confidence":0.92,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"500","start":7450,"end":7700,"confidence":0.9400000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"errors","start":7800,"end":8050,"confidence":0.9600000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"on","start":8150,"end":8400,"confidence":0.92,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"Black","start":8500,"end":8750,"confidence":0.9400000000000001,"word_is_final":false},{"text":"Friday","start":8850,"end":9100,"co